# Docs

`README.md` is how to try the test level. `docs/adding-to-a-game.md` is how to copy Golem into another Godot project.

Update both in the same work when any of these change:

- controls or input action names
- player options the Escape menu exposes
- collision layers or the player mask
- which files another project has to copy

Write in plain language. Use the action names and key codes that are actually in the scripts and in `project.godot`.

If a script default and the input map disagree, say both. Do not pick one and hide the other.
